---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Rankings — Azeroth" page="rankings">
  <section class="page-hero wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Competitive</p><h1>Arena rankings</h1><p>The realm's leading teams, ratings, records, and members.</p></section>
  <section class="wrap content-section"><div class="view-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">TOP TEAMS</p><h2>Arena ladder</h2></div><div class="ranking-controls"><label>Season<select id="ranking-season"><option>Season 8</option><option>Season 7</option><option>Season 6</option></select></label><div class="bracket-picker"><button class="active" data-bracket="2">2v2</button><button data-bracket="3">3v3</button><button data-bracket="5">5v5</button></div></div></div><div id="arena-ranking" class="ranking-table"><div class="skeleton"></div></div><p id="season-note" class="muted">Current season uses the live AzerothCore arena tables. Archived seasons require retained snapshots.</p></section>
  <section class="wrap content-section"><div class="view-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">REALM LEADERS</p><h2>Character and guild rankings</h2></div><div class="bracket-picker" id="ranking-metrics"><button class="active" data-metric="honorable-kills">Honorable kills</button><button data-metric="achievements">Achievements</button><button data-metric="played-time">Played time</button><button data-metric="level">Level</button><button data-metric="guild-members">Guild size</button></div></div><div id="ranking-filters" class="ranking-filterbar"><label>Class<select id="ranking-class"><option value="0">All classes</option><option value="1">Warrior</option><option value="2">Paladin</option><option value="3">Hunter</option><option value="4">Rogue</option><option value="5">Priest</option><option value="6">Death Knight</option><option value="7">Shaman</option><option value="8">Mage</option><option value="9">Warlock</option><option value="11">Druid</option></select></label><label>Specialization<input id="ranking-spec" list="ranking-specs" placeholder="All specs"/><datalist id="ranking-specs"><option value="Arms"/><option value="Protection"/><option value="Retribution"/><option value="Holy"/><option value="Frost"/><option value="Unholy"/><option value="Feral"/><option value="Elemental"/><option value="Affliction"/><option value="Assassination"/><option value="Marksmanship"/></datalist></label><label>Faction<select id="ranking-faction"><option value="">Both factions</option><option value="alliance">Alliance</option><option value="horde">Horde</option></select></label></div><div id="character-ranking" class="ranking-table"><div class="skeleton"></div></div></section>
  <section class="wrap content-section"><div class="view-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">RAID COMPETITION</p><h2>Speed rankings and recent kills</h2></div></div><div class="ranking-split"><article><h3>Fastest clears</h3><div id="raid-speed" class="ranking-table"><div class="skeleton"></div></div></article><article><h3>Recent boss kills</h3><div id="recent-kills" class="ranking-table"><div class="skeleton"></div></div></article></div><p class="muted">Timed rankings are populated from the optional portal raid-history table. Stock AzerothCore achievement data only supplies kill dates.</p></section>
</Layout>
